            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What is the best protein powder for coffee?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                For hot coffee, collagen peptides such as Vital Proteins dissolve most easily, though collagen is an incomplete protein. For iced or cooled coffee, an unflavored whey isolate such as NOW Sports gives about 25 g of complete protein with a neutral taste. If you want a coffee flavor built in, Dymatize ISO100's Dunkin' flavors are designed for it.
