              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Yes, but whey tends to clump in very hot coffee because the heat unfolds its proteins before the powder dissolves. Mix the powder into a few tablespoons of cold milk or water first, let the coffee cool slightly, or use a handheld frother. Collagen peptides dissolve in hot coffee without any special method.
