                Collagen is better for convenience, because it dissolves easily in hot coffee and has almost no taste. Whey isolate is better for nutrition, because it is a complete protein rich in leucine, while collagen lacks tryptophan. Many people use collagen in hot coffee and whey isolate in iced coffee or after workouts.
              </p>
