              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                You can, but it works best in iced coffee made in a blender. Pea and rice proteins tend to feel gritty and settle in hot coffee. Blend a vanilla plant protein with cold brew, ice and soy or oat milk for a smoother drink. Collagen is the easiest dairy-free option for hot coffee, but it is not vegan.
